"The cut-off is the value that maximises the standardised log-rank statistic "
"(maximally selected rank statistic, survminer::surv_cutpoint / maxstat). No "
"multiplicity-adjusted p-value is computed or reported for the selected "
"cut-off; the group comparison p-values shown after the split are exploratory "
"because the split was chosen from these same data. Report the continuous Cox "
"model as the primary analysis and validate the cut-off in independent data. "
"When publishing, cite survminer and maxstat."
msgstr ""

